Japanese ramen. The preparation of the broth takes hours.

71
00:04:25.583 --> 00:04:26.770
And Khmer food?

72
00:04:27.883 --> 00:04:31.764
The preservation of heritage cuisine protects our regional identity.

73
00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:34.586
Part three: grammar.

74
00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:38.552
Grammar focus: Abstract noun phrases.

75
00:04:38.852 --> 00:04:40.016
Look at the pattern.

76
00:04:40.717 --> 00:04:44.551
The exploration of global cuisine broadens cultural understanding.

77
00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:48.622
The preservation of heritage cuisine protects identity.

78
00:04:49.517 --> 00:04:51.737
The sharing of meals builds friendship.

79
00:04:52.700 --> 00:05:01.552
Abstract noun phrases make ideas sound general and formal. The main noun (exploration) decides the verb: The exploration … broadens.

80
00:05:02.317 --> 00:05:06.978
Be careful! Don't say: The exploration of new foods broaden our minds.

81
00:05:08.933 --> 00:05:12.674
Say: The exploration of new foods broadens our minds.

82
00:05:12.974 --> 00:05:16.472
The main noun 'exploration' is singular, so the verb takes -s.

83
00:05:17.267 --> 00:05:19.873
Part four: reading. Read and listen.

84
