A, broadens. B, broaden. C, broadening.

93
00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.941
The answer is A: broadens.

94
00:06:01.083 --> 00:06:04.279
Travelling to enjoy local food is gastronomic blank.

95
00:06:04.579 --> 00:06:09.590
A, tourism. B, diplomacy. C, identity.

96
00:06:13.133 --> 00:06:15.458
The answer is A: tourism.

97
00:06:16.617 --> 00:06:18.756
Cooking with science is molecular blank.

98
00:06:19.056 --> 00:06:23.348
A, gastronomy. B, anthropology. C, palate.

99
00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:29.039
The answer is A: gastronomy.

100
